<title>POLAND: Polish food prices fall 1.4 pct in June 21-30.</title>
<headline>Polish food prices fall 1.4 pct in June 21-30.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish food prices eased 1.4 percent in the June 21-30 period after falling 1.6 percent in the previous 10 days but were 1.5 percent higher than in the May 21-31 period, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said.</p>
<p>				  JUNE 21-30   JUNE 11-20  LAST 30 DAYS</p>
<p>POLISH FOOD PRICES (AVG)     -1.4	  -1.6	  1.5 (2.7)</p>
<p> Bread				0.1	   0.0	  0.2 (0.2)</p>
<p> Fruit and vegetables	  -9.1	  -9.4	 11.6(20.5)</p>
<p> Meat and meat-products	 0.1	   0.1	  0.1 (0.0)</p>
<p> Dairy products		   0.2	   0.1	  0.7 (0.7)</p>
<p> Eggs				-1.7	  -1.9	 -6.8(-6.9)</p>
<p>NOTE: In brackets figures for the previous 30-day period ending on June 20.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
